       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TPCO07.
      * COMPANY OWNER CATEGORY FOR THE CDD FILE
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-STAKE                  PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-APPOINTS-MAJORITY      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-POLICY-RIGHTS          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-CATEGORY               PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-STAKE
           ACCEPT WS-APPOINTS-MAJORITY
           ACCEPT WS-POLICY-RIGHTS
           PERFORM 2000-CATEGORY
           DISPLAY 'CATEGORY: ' WS-CATEGORY
           STOP RUN.
       2000-CATEGORY.
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN WS-STAKE > 25
                 MOVE 'BO-OWNERSHIP' TO WS-CATEGORY
              WHEN WS-APPOINTS-MAJORITY = 'Y'
              WHEN WS-POLICY-RIGHTS = 'Y'
                 MOVE 'BO-CONTROL' TO WS-CATEGORY
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE 'NOT-BO' TO WS-CATEGORY
           END-EVALUATE.
